<title>FRANCE: Rolls Royce to power new Airbus models.</title>
<headline>Rolls Royce to power new Airbus models.</headline>
<dateline>LE BOURGET, France 1997-06-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Airbus Industrie Managing Director Jean Pierson said on Sunday that Rolls Royce Plc had been chosen to provide Trent-500 engines to power Airbus's new A340-500 and A340-600 four-engine, widebody jets.</p>
<p>Pierson reporters at a news conference that commercial imperatives had dictated the choice of Rolls Royce for the project.</p>
